SmartBank AI - Updated files

Replace these three files in your existing project folder:
- app.py
- banking_tools.py
- customer_db.py

Keep your existing .env file and loan_api.py. Do not overwrite your .env file.
The existing .env should contain GROQ_API_KEY=your_key (do not share the key).

Run in terminal 1:
venv\Scripts\activate
python -m uvicorn loan_api:app --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8081 --reload

Run in terminal 2:
venv\Scripts\activate
python -m streamlit run app.py

Open http://localhost:8501

The app creates smartbank.db automatically and inserts CUST001 if it does not already exist.
New customers receive IDs like CUST002, CUST003, etc.
Loan application submission still requires the confirmation checkbox and uses the mock FastAPI endpoint.
